Scope and method
----------------
Licence identifiers below were taken from package metadata (Python distribution
metadata and npm registry `license` fields) and from licence files committed to
this repository. Where a package publishes a dual or compound licence, the full
expression is reproduced rather than simplified.

AtOM links to almost all of its dependencies as unmodified libraries
resolved at install time; it does not vendor their source. Full licence texts
ship inside each package's own distribution. For the items this repository
physically redistributes, the licence text is committed alongside the files and
the path is given below.

This notice covers direct dependencies. Package managers resolve additional
transitive packages whose licences are recorded in the resulting lockfile or
site-packages tree; generate a full inventory from an installed environment when
you need a complete, deployment-specific bill of materials.

